                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0111150"}> arxiv:hep-th/0111150
                )
          %p The chiral boson in 2d:
          %ul
            %li#Srivastava89
              %p
                Prem P. Srivastava,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantization of self-dual field revisited
                %strong 63
                (1989) 2791 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.63.2791"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.63.2791
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#GGR92
              %p
                H. O. Girotti, M. Gomes, and V. O. Rivelles,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Chiral bosons through linear constraints
                %strong 45
                (1992) R3329(R) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.45.R3329"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevD.45.R3329
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#GBMNV
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luis+Alvarez-Gaum%C3%A9"}> Luis Alvarez-Gaumé
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean-Benoit+Bost"} Jean-Benoit Bost
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Greg+Moore"} Greg Moore
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Bosonization On Higher Genus Riemann Surfaces
                = succeed "," do
