              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %em Higher abelian gauge theory associated to gerbes on noncommutative deformed M5-branes and S-duality
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1404.2257"} arXiv:1404.2257
          %p
            Discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conformal+blocks"} conformal blocks
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+quantization"} geometric quantization
            of self-dual higher gauge theories is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kiyonori+Gomi"}> Kiyonori Gomi
